  title: 'How Many Days Is Enough for a First Trip to Europe?',
  excerpt: 'Europe is too big to see in one trip. Here is how to choose the right number of days, build a realistic first itinerary, and avoid spending your holiday rushing from one city to another.',
  category: 'Travel Tips',
