  title: 'What Is the Cheapest Day to Fly? Here’s What Travelers Should Know',
  excerpt: 'Wondering whether Tuesday really is the cheapest day to fly? The answer is more complicated than the old travel myth suggests. Here is how to think about flight timing and find a better fare.',
  category: 'Travel Tips',
  readTime: '7 min read',
  publishedDate: 'August 20, 2026',
