  title: 'What Should You Know Before Going White-Water Rafting?',
  excerpt: 'Thinking about trying white-water rafting for the first time? Learn what to expect, what to wear, how difficult rapids can be, what to pack, and how to prepare for a safe and unforgettable adventure.',
  category: 'Adventure',
