  title: 'How Do I Choose the Best Airline for My Trip?',
  excerpt: 'Choosing an airline is about more than finding the lowest fare. Learn how to compare schedules, baggage, aircraft, connections, comfort, flexibility, and total travel cost before booking.',
  category: 'Airline Reviews',
