  title: 'How to Plan a Weekend Layover Without Missing Your Flight',
  excerpt: 'A long layover can become a mini adventure. Learn how to plan a weekend layover, explore a city, manage your time, and still make it back to the airport comfortably.',
  category: 'Itineraries',
  readTime: '5 min read',
